  "sections": [
    {
      "block_id": "h1-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "GitHub Pages — Artifact-Rendered Documentation Site",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Rig Relay's documentation site is generated from structured artifacts, not raw Markdown. The pipeline is:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-3",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "Markdown files (docs/, non-root)\n  → inventory_markdown()      scan + extract metadata\n  → write_all_artifacts()     JSON/JSONL/CSV artifacts\n  → render_site()             static HTML + CSS\n  → GitHub Pages deploy       actions/pages",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Local render",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-5",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "bash",
      "content": "uv run python scripts/rig_relay_docs_artifacts.py --render",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Outputs under `site/` (not committed): - `index.html` — overview, counts, recent docs - `documents.html` — all documents - `governance.html`, `audits.html`, `demos.html` — by kind - `code-fences.html` — extracted code blocks - `links.html` — extracted hyperlinks - `assets/site.css` — dark theme, no external CDN - `.nojekyll` — disables Jekyll processing",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Local doctor",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-8",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "bash",
      "content": "uv run python scripts/rig_relay_docs_artifacts.py --doctor",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Checks: artifacts exist, `site/index.html` exists, `.nojekyll` exists, no private paths leaked, no root Markdown converted.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-10",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Excluded files",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Root Markdown files (README.md, AGENTS.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, etc.) are excluded from the artifact pipeline. They remain as project-level documentation, not docs-site content.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Vendor/cache directories (`.git`, `.venv`, `.build`, `node_modules`, `__pycache__`) are excluded from scanning.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "GitHub Pages deployment",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The workflow at `.github/workflows/pages.yml` runs on push to `main` when `docs/`, `rig_relay/docs_render/`, or the workflow itself changes.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "It: 1. Checks out the repo 2. Installs uv and syncs dependencies 3. Runs `scripts/rig_relay_docs_artifacts.py --render` 4. Verifies `site/index.html` and `.nojekyll` 5. Uploads `site/` as a Pages artifact 6. Deploys to GitHub Pages",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Manual dispatch is also available from the Actions tab.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-17",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Configuration",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "GitHub Pages source must be set to \"GitHub Actions\" in the repository settings: Settings → Pages → Build and deployment → Source: GitHub Actions.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "No branch-based deployment is needed.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    }
  ],
